Usage: ai-cockpit archive [OPTIONS] --repo <REPO> --id <ID>

Options:
      --repo <REPO>          
      --id <ID>              
      --json                 Emit valid JSON; the full Outcome remains in outcomeDelivery while the separate human handoff on stderr is suppressed
      --language <LANGUAGE>  Conversation language for the archived human Outcome delivery [possible values: en, zh, zh-CN, ja]
  -h, --help                 Print help
